/*
 * runtime-version-pin.compact — pin note for Compact runtime 0.16.0 vs API reference 0.20.0.
 *
 * Upstream: https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-docs/issues/1564
 * Official: https://docs.midnight.network/relnotes/support-matrix
 *
 * Networks (Preview / Preprod / Mainnet) run ledger 8.
 * Support matrix pairs them with Compact toolchain 0.31.1, Compact runtime 0.16.0,
 * Midnight.js 4.1.1. Runtimes 0.19.0 / 0.20.0 target ledger 9 and are incompatible.
 *
 * This source uses only language features valid under language_version ~0.23.
 * It does not import or call ledger-9-only runtime helpers.
 * LOCAL-TRUE. Source only. Not compiled here. Not deployed.
 * Does not claim a fix of the public indexer or node.
 *
 * Pins: Compact ~0.31.1 / language ~0.23, midnight-js 4.1.1, DApp Connector 4.0.1, proof-server 8.1.0.
 *
 * Built by @kshot9000 https://x.com/kshot9000
